      <h1 class="jr-h1">Vitamin D Deficiency Symptoms: What Is Real and What Is Not</h1>
      <p class="jr-standfirst">Almost every page on this subject hands you a list of fifteen symptoms, no blood thresholds and no doses. The useful version is narrower and less flattering: deficiency is usually silent, the symptoms that do show up are specific, and the dose that corrects it is not the dose in your multivitamin.</p>

